{
  "name": "Customer on a per-seat monthly plan, with a mid-term seat expansion",
  "description": "A reusable 'Team' plan prices seats at $15 per seat per month, billed on the 1st and earned over the month. Both the bill and the service activity compute the month's price with a rate calculation, seats x $15, from a `seats` term the contract sets (10). July bills and earns $150 (4110 subscription revenue) and MRR is $150. A signed seat change adds 4 seats from August 1: contracts.amend sets `seats` to 14 on both activities, effective 2026-08-01, so July's bill, revenue and MRR stay as they were while August bills and earns $210 and MRR rises to $210 (ARR $2,520). No new contract and no second plan: the amendment is a new dated version of the same contract.",
